       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>He sent forth</i>
a horse [or beast] <i>to the place of pasture</i> [app.
<i>in the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَادِيَة</span>, or <i>desert</i>]. (TA, from a trad.)

